[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15541.51, "timestamp": "04:19:01", "text": "别担心，罗孚。我们只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15545.189, "timestamp": "04:19:05", "text": "今天闲聊。此外，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15549.229, "timestamp": "04:19:09", "text": "她同意和我一起来这里只是为了更多的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15554.309, "timestamp": "04:19:14", "text": "哦，当然。尽管问。一切都始于我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15555.63, "timestamp": "04:19:15", "text": "一个世纪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15559.59, "timestamp": "04:19:19", "text": "前。在一次TD爆发期间，我的主人是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15563.189, "timestamp": "04:19:23", "text": "被那个人救了。她散发着……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15567.03, "timestamp": "04:19:27", "text": "他拥有独特的能量，而且总是难以捉摸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.75, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "我的主人搜寻之后，仔细翻找了一番。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15572.79, "timestamp": "04:19:32", "text": "好几年了。他终于见到了那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15576.309, "timestamp": "04:19:36", "text": "又有人在发酵山上了。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15578.55, "timestamp": "04:19:38", "text": "起初，我以为我的主人指的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15581.03, "timestamp": "04:19:41", "text": "比赛记录包含实际信息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15584.07, "timestamp": "04:19:44", "text": "关于时间危机，但那只是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15584.83, "timestamp": "04:19:44", "text": "一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15588.229, "timestamp": "04:19:48", "text": "线索。最后，秘密是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15590.149, "timestamp": "04:19:50", "text": "不朽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15593.309, "timestamp": "04:19:53", "text": "那里有一处木场。它不是"}]